{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/extras/d15e94fcb14200e3dd4458dfa1d33771.poster.avif?t=1764572836\" width=800 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/extras/d15e94fcb14200e3dd4458dfa1d33771.webm?t=1764572836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/extras/d15e94fcb14200e3dd4458dfa1d33771.mp4?t=1764572836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Into the Fold-Nala Junction</strong> is a fast-paced  short horror  in which you fight, shoot, rip, and run for your life- 90s-style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/extras/998922b25ee77c7acbe67dc4d47400da.poster.avif?t=1764572836\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/extras/998922b25ee77c7acbe67dc4d47400da.webm?t=1764572836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Into the Fold - Nala Junction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You came to document a remote mountain retreat near a quiet, secluded village with a secret no one talks about. It should have been simple: observe, record, and leave.\u00a0Now the night won\u2019t end, and it keeps calling, and they will do anything to keep it a secret.   <br>But the old train near Nala Junction may be your only way out. Catch it before they catch you</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore an abandoned, isolated retreat</strong> tangled in ritual.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect corrupted tapes and documents</strong> to uncover what they  truly want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run and fight</strong>: Use weapons, no stealth, no mercy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light parkour: </strong>Escape before they catch you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow-building sense of dread</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/extras/d81d7697b9e589b8a8db4e56e6a7ac1b.poster.avif?t=1764572836\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/extras/d81d7697b9e589b8a8db4e56e6a7ac1b.webm?t=1764572836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3639770?t=1764572836","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/650994b311c396582c2b22e8e333b8316b9b97ee/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764572836","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/93d2b066c04c931f876644c209b829ef3cbbb157/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764572836","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/93d2b066c04c931f876644c209b829ef3cbbb157/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764572836","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Blood and Gore\r\nViolence\r\nHorror"},"demos":[{"appid":3703800,"description"